{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":61,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大喜的讯息"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["主耶和华的灵在我身上，因为耶和华膏立了我，",{"text":"让我传福音给贫穷的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣我医治伤心的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告被掳的人得释放、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被囚的人得自由；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告耶和华的恩年和我们上帝报仇的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安慰一切悲哀的人；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以华冠取代锡安哀伤者头上的灰尘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以喜乐的膏油取代他们的哀伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以颂赞的外袍取代他们的灰心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们将被称为耶和华所栽种的公义橡树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以彰显祂的荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必重修古老的荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修复久已毁坏之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建历代荒废的城邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"异乡客要为你们牧放羊群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人要为你们耕种田地、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照料葡萄园。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要被称为耶和华的祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们上帝的臣仆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必享用各国的财富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夸耀自己拥有他们的荣华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们曾经蒙受耻辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今将得到双倍的福分；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们曾经遭受屈辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今将因得到产业而快乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将在自己的土地上得到双倍的福分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受永远的快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“因为我耶和华喜爱公正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎恶抢劫之罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必凭信实赏赐我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与他们立永远的约。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的后代必享誉列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"子孙必名闻万邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看见的人都承认他们是蒙耶和华赐福之民。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我因耶和华而无比喜乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的上帝而心里快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂给我穿上救恩的衣服、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"披上公义的袍子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我像戴上华冠的新郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像戴上饰物的新娘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地怎样使嫩苗长出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"园子怎样使种子发芽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华必照样使公义与颂赞在万民中滋长。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}